  "notes": [
    "Retained initial TypeScript fixture option, test type-alias, Node globals/unused import, and native about:blank readiness diagnostics; corrected each without weakening checks.",
    "Default axe found missing headings, prohibited generic-span aria-label and ambiguous visible Play text. Added hidden headings, a bars image role and the existing library Play SVG; default axe remains fully enabled.",
    "Preserved all interim successful captures and failed run logs. Final visual comparison restores transparent skip buttons, exact peek sizes/gaps and 13px medium chips; original Figma SVGs remain byte-identical.",
    "Windows returned UNKNOWN while rewriting an identical generated motion CSS file. Generation now skips byte-identical content; generated output is unchanged.",
    "Final release is rebuilt after the final frontend; native smoke asserts the embedded JS entry and every built static stylesheet. Earlier native/bundle manifests do not establish final acceptance.",
    "All v51/v52 source evidence is preserved. No real GSMTC session, Core Audio device, global input, user account/profile, OS setting or installer is exercised."
